 crop/1/src_region/0,0,1351,1351/628_cs_-_summer_26_Berry_Picking_U-pick.re
 v.1782944053.jpg
CATEGORIES:Department Events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fantastic afternoon on the farm. U-pick flowers\
 , fruits and vegetables while exploring the grounds and shopping at our fa
 rm stand.  We will also be selling cut flowers\, vegetables\, fruit\, beef
 \, and value-added goods including olive oil and berry preserves.What to b
 ring:  Bring your own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If you bri
 ng wicker\, metal\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before you head
  out to the field.  We recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and comfortab
 le shoes and bringing a water bottle.Event detailsFree admittance &amp\; o
 pen to the public  Kid &amp\; family friendly  Card and tap-to-pay accepte
 d  Free parking and admission  No reservation needed  Meet our students an
 d see them in action!  No dogs permitted\, except assistance dogs  For mor
 e information\, click here to visit Shone Farm's U-Pick page. (https://sho
 nefarm.santarosa.edu/summer-u-pick)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260701T223053Z
LOCATION:Shone Farm
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/21266-summer-u-pick-at-shone-farm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for a fantastic afternoon on the
  farm. U-pick flowers\, fruits and vegetables while exploring the grounds 
 and shopping at our farm stand.</p><p>  We will also be selling cut flower
 s\, vegetables\, fruit\, beef\, and value-added goods including olive oil 
 and berry preserves.</p><p><strong>What to bring:</strong><br />  Bring yo
 ur own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If you bring wicker\, met
 al\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before you head out to the fie
 ld.</p><p>  We recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and comfortable shoes
  and bringing a water bottle.</p><p><strong>Event details</strong></p><ul>
 <li>Free admittance &amp\; open to the public  </li><li>Kid &amp\; family 
 friendly  </li><li>Card and tap-to-pay accepted  </li><li>Free parking and
  admission  </li><li>No reservation needed  </li><li>Meet our students and
  see them in action!  </li><li>No dogs permitted\, except assistance dogs 
  </li></ul><p><a href="https://shonefarm.santarosa.edu/summer-u-pick" targ
 et="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, click here to visit Shon
 e Farm's U-Pick page.</a></p>
