SUMMARY: End-of-Summer Self Care Retreat
DESCRIPTION:End your summer feeling refreshed with Allume Medspa's Self-C
 are Retreat! Take time to relax\, recharge\, and invest in your well-bein
 g before the busy season begins. Enjoy a rejuvenating spa experience that
  includes a 30-minute Glow Facial\, LED Light Therapy\, Chair Massage\, L
 ymphatic Drainage\, Cervical Neck Care\, Sound Bath Immersion\, Essential
  Oil Aromatherapy\, Paraffin Hand Treatment\, and complimentary spa refre
 shments.\n\nSaturday\, August 15\n\nAppointments available from 9:00 AM–2
 :00 PM. This is a private\, appointment-based experience\, and you'll res
 erve your preferred time when booking.\n\nPricing:\n\n• $119 for one gues
 t\n\n• $199 for two guests\n\nThe two-person package may be purchased thr
 ough Eventbrite. To reserve a single-person retreat\, please call 707-787
 -7095 or email info@allumemedspa.com mailto:info@allumemedspa.com . Space
  is limited\, so reserve your relaxing retreat today!
