 ery Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits with w
 aste.  An SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin and Arts
 tart.  Opening reception for the Beautiful TRASH exhibit: 4:30-6:30pm.  On
 going exhibit: August 24 to December 11\, 2026.  SRJC Petaluma: 680 Sonoma
  Mtn. Parkway\, Petaluma\, CA 94954-2522For more information about the Her
 old Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https://libraries
