  farm. U-pick flowers\, fruits and vegetables while exploring the grounds 
 and shopping at our farm stand.</p><p>  We will also be selling cut flower
 s\, vegetables\, fruit\, beef\, and value-added goods including olive oil 
 and berry preserves.</p><p><strong>What to bring:</strong><br />  Bring yo
 ur own basket/container to help us reduce waste! If you bring wicker\, met
 al\, or thick plastic\, stop by the cashier before you head out to the fie
 ld.</p><p>  We recommend wearing sunscreen\, a hat\, and comfortable shoes
  and bringing a water bottle.</p><p><strong>Event details</strong></p><ul>
 <li>Free admittance &amp\; open to the public  </li><li>Kid &amp\; family 
 friendly  </li><li>Card and tap-to-pay accepted  </li><li>Free parking and
