SUMMARY:Transit Month Read and Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T123000
UID:a9252ad653b8321a612d67ea1102511b@coolpetaluma.org
DESCRIPTION:Come ride the bus with us! We’ll meet at the Copeland St. bu
 s stop at 11:00 AM to ride the westbound Route 11 loop together with speci
 al guest Maria Arce\, Division Manager of Petaluma Transit. Maria will sha
 re what’s happening with our local bus system and offer her reflections 
 on September’s Cool Book Club selection\, Confessions of a Recovering En
 gineer. After our 30-minute scenic ride\, we’ll land at Grand Central Ca
 fé for coffee\, conversation\, and a chance to give Petaluma Transit some
  direct feedback. Never ridden the bus before? This is the perfect time to
  start\, and we’ll be right there with you. Want more of the backstory? 
 Join us to kick off Transit Month with a Cool Books discussion on 9/1 to w
 het our appetites for the bus. No worries if you can’t make it to Book C
 lub on 9/1 or don’t have the chance to read the book\, just come on the 
